OL,3,GNEWSATeenagers sentenced for
OL,4,Asupermarket machete attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo teenagers have been given custodial
OL,7,Fsentences after a machete attack at a
OL,8,Fsupermarket in Sutton-in-Ashfield.
OL,10,FNottinghamshire Police said it happened
OL,11,Fin the entrance foyer of Asda in
OL,12,FPriestsic Road shortly before midnight
OL,13,Fon 13 March.
OL,15,FCCTV footage showed two groups talking
OL,16,Fnear the self-service checkouts before
OL,17,Fmoving towards the store's entrance.
OL,18,FAccording to the force, two teenagers
OL,19,Ffrom one of the groups then produced
OL,20,Fmachetes and launched the attack on
OL,21,Fthree males.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
