OL,3,GNEWSATeenagers sentenced for
OL,4,Asupermarket machete attack
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo boys, 16 and 17, who cannot be
OL,7,Fnamed for legal reasons, were each
OL,8,Fsentenced to 10 years at Nottingham
OL,9,FCrown Court on Friday after admitting
OL,10,Fthree counts of wounding and possession
OL,11,Fof a knife blade in a public place.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
